ps/bugzilla/bugzilla-version-xxx.ebuild', or edit the .ebuild file manual=
ly, insert the keyword alpha, run 'ebuild www-apps/bugzilla/bugzilla-vers=
ion-xxx.ebuild digest' and emerge as usual.

